      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003ch3 id=&#92;&quot;answer-q3&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eAnswer -- Q3&#92;u003c/h3&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cul&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eThe KB explains the #2 DMS hit: &#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003eS220T&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e was independently&#92;n  interpreted as &#92;&quot;at the mouth of the active site cleft&#92;&quot;,&#92;n  restricting access of the wrong substrate conformer and lifting&#92;n  ee from 30% to 96% (Gilio et al. 2022, reading Ma et al. 2021).&#92;n  Our distance-to-cofactor analysis called S220 &#92;&quot;distal&#92;&quot;; the KB&#92;n  corrects the &#92;u003cem&#92;u003einterpretation&#92;u003c/em&#92;u003e, not the geometry.&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eThe KB warns that &#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003elinear additivity holds outside the active&#92;n  site&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e but breaks down inside it -- a falsifiable claim that&#92;n  Q5 will test against the data.&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eIt documents the engineered winner (&#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003eQ194L/S220T/H230Y&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e,&#92;n  99% ee) and the ML-guided alternative (M129L/A156S/Y177W).&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eThe KB is &#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003esilent on A296I&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e. Prior work ends where this demo&#92;n  begins.&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ul&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output>"
